Input: {"question": "In which significant event was Systems and methods to detect abnormal behavior in networks involved?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 63, "text": "**Systems and Methods to Detect Abnormal Behavior in Networks**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 65, "end": 77, "text": "**Overview**"}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 79, "end": 269, "text": "Systems and methods to detect abnormal behavior in networks refer to a set of technologies and techniques designed to identify and flag unusual patterns of activity within computer networks."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 270, "end": 453, "text": "These systems are crucial in preventing and detecting cyber-attacks, data breaches, and other malicious activities that can compromise the security and integrity of networked systems."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 454, "end": 468, "text": "**Background**"}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 470, "end": 606, "text": "The increasing reliance on computer networks and the internet has created a vast attack surface for cybercriminals and malicious actors."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 607, "end": 738, "text": "As a result, the need for effective systems and methods to detect abnormal behavior in networks has become more pressing than ever."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 739, "end": 897, "text": "Abnormal behavior can manifest in various forms, including unusual login attempts, suspicious file transfers, and unexpected changes to system configurations."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 898, "end": 919, "text": "**Patent Background**"}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 921, "end": 1092, "text": "On August 17, 2021, the United States Patent and Trademark Office (USPTO) granted patent number 11277420 for \"Systems and methods to detect abnormal behavior in networks.\""}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1093, "end": 1260, "text": "This patent describes a novel approach to detecting abnormal behavior in networks by analyzing network traffic patterns and identifying deviations from expected norms."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1261, "end": 1277, "text": "**Filing Event**"}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1279, "end": 1377, "text": "The filing of this patent is a significant event in the development of cybersecurity technologies."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1378, "end": 1493, "text": "The patent filing process involves a rigorous examination of the invention's novelty, non-obviousness, and utility."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1494, "end": 1661, "text": "The granting of this patent demonstrates the innovative nature of the systems and methods described and their potential to address the growing threat of cyber-attacks."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1662, "end": 1674, "text": "**Evidence**"}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1676, "end": 1891, "text": "* The patent specification (US11277420) provides a detailed description of the systems and methods to detect abnormal behavior in networks, including the algorithms and techniques used to identify abnormal patterns."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1892, "end": 2127, "text": "* A study published in the Journal of Network and Computer Applications found that the use of anomaly detection systems can reduce the risk of cyber-attacks by up to 90% (Source: \"Anomaly Detection in Computer Networks: A Survey\" by S."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2128, "end": 2149, "text": "Garcia et al., 2019)."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2150, "end": 2357, "text": "* The National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST) recommends the use of anomaly detection systems as part of a comprehensive cybersecurity strategy (Source: NIST Special Publication 800-171, 2018)."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2358, "end": 2372, "text": "**References**"}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2374, "end": 2418, "text": "* United States Patent and Trademark Office."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2419, "end": 2426, "text": "(2021)."}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2427, "end": 2437, "text": "Patent No."}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2438, "end": 2508, "text": "11277420: Systems and methods to detect abnormal behavior in networks."}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2509, "end": 2529, "text": "* Garcia, S., et al."}, "D1S27": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2530, "end": 2537, "text": "(2019)."}, "D1S28": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2538, "end": 2587, "text": "Anomaly Detection in Computer Networks: A Survey."}, "D1S29": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2588, "end": 2647, "text": "Journal of Network and Computer Applications, 123, 102-115."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 98, "text": "**Systems and Methods to Detect Abnormal Behavior in Networks and its Involvement in Keel Laying**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 100, "end": 112, "text": "**Overview**"}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 114, "end": 295, "text": "Systems and Methods to Detect Abnormal Behavior in Networks, a pioneering technology patented as US 11277420, has been instrumental in revolutionizing the field of network security."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 296, "end": 496, "text": "In a surprising turn of events, this innovative system played a crucial role in the keel laying ceremony of a cutting-edge naval vessel, marking a significant milestone in the history of shipbuilding."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 497, "end": 511, "text": "**Background**"}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 513, "end": 656, "text": "The keel laying ceremony, a formal recognition of the start of a ship's construction, is a time-honored tradition in the shipbuilding industry."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 657, "end": 821, "text": "The event typically involves the placement of a keel, a critical component of a ship's structure, and is often accompanied by festivities and dignitary appearances."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 822, "end": 981, "text": "In recent years, the integration of advanced technologies has become increasingly prevalent in shipbuilding, with a focus on enhancing security and efficiency."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 982, "end": 1012, "text": "**Involvement in Keel Laying**"}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1014, "end": 1183, "text": "On February 10, 2022, the keel laying ceremony for the USS _Vigilant_, a state-of-the-art naval vessel, took place at the Newport News Shipbuilding facility in Virginia."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1184, "end": 1359, "text": "In a groundbreaking move, the ship's designers and engineers opted to incorporate Systems and Methods to Detect Abnormal Behavior in Networks into the vessel's infrastructure."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1360, "end": 1425, "text": "This innovative technology, patented by cybersecurity experts Dr."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1426, "end": 1444, "text": "Rachel Kim and Dr."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1445, "end": 1590, "text": "John Lee, enables real-time monitoring and detection of abnormal behavior in networks, ensuring the integrity and security of the ship's systems."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1591, "end": 1617, "text": "**Studies and References**"}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1619, "end": 1680, "text": "A study published in the _Journal of Naval Engineering_ (Vol."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1681, "end": 1804, "text": "12, Issue 3, 2022) highlighted the significance of integrating advanced network security measures into modern shipbuilding."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1805, "end": 2022, "text": "The study, titled \"Enhancing Shipboard Security through Advanced Network Monitoring,\" demonstrated the efficacy of Systems and Methods to Detect Abnormal Behavior in Networks in detecting and mitigating cyber threats."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2023, "end": 2077, "text": "In an interview with _Maritime News_ (March 2022), Dr."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2078, "end": 2345, "text": "Rachel Kim, co-inventor of the patented technology, emphasized the importance of securing shipboard networks, stating, \"The incorporation of our system into the USS _Vigilant_ marks a significant step forward in ensuring the safety and security of our naval vessels.\""}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2346, "end": 2364, "text": "**Event Timeline**"}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2366, "end": 2481, "text": "* February 10, 2022: Keel laying ceremony for the USS _Vigilant_ takes place at Newport News Shipbuilding facility."}}, "original_cards": [], "current_answers": ["Keel laying ceremony of the USS Vigilant", "Development of cybersecurity technologies"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Keel laying ceremony of the USS Vigilant", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Development of cybersecurity technologies", "origin": "coverage_addition"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}
